🟫 Flight Booking
CLASS Flight EXTENDS BookingService:
    FUNCTION __init__():
        INITIALIZE available_flights AS list of dictionaries

    FUNCTION book():
        DISPLAY available flights
        ASK user to choose flight and travel date
        VALIDATE seat selection
        REMOVE selected seat
        RETURN booking details

    FUNCTION cancel(user, booking_detail):
        IF booking_detail starts with "Flight:":
            PRINT cancellation message
            RETURN user.cancel_booking(booking_detail)








